            "livenessProbe": {
              "httpGet": {
                "port": 80,
                "path": "/"
              },
              "initialDelaySeconds": 5, 
              "periodSeconds": 15 
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
```
I will use slightly more conservative `initialDelaySeconds` and `periodSeconds` to allow the application time to settle, although for Nginx this might not be strictly necessary. I will stick to the structure and only change the path and port from the previous successful patch.

